In src/constants/type.ts next to DISPLAY_FONT, export plain style objects and spread them into existing StyleSheets:
  capLabel = { color: '#6d7076', fontSize: 10.5, fontWeight: '700', letterSpacing: 1.6 }
  capLabelAccent = { ...capLabel, color: '#c3cdd6' }
  kicker = { color: '#8f99a3', fontSize: 10, fontWeight: '700', letterSpacing: 1.6 }
  eyebrow = { color: '#c3cdd6', fontSize: 9.5, fontWeight: '700', letterSpacing: 1.4 }
  eyebrowLg = { ...eyebrow, fontSize: 10, letterSpacing: 1.6 }   (ticket detail card only)
  stockLeft = { fontSize: 11, fontWeight: '700', letterSpacing: 1.2 }   ('N LEFT' on shop card and drop page)
  sectionHead = { fontFamily: DISPLAY_FONT, fontSize: 15, letterSpacing: 2, color: '#f4f5f6' }   (the TOP 3 style)
  pageTitle = { color: '#f4f5f6', fontSize: 22, fontFamily: DISPLAY_FONT, letterSpacing: 2 }
  pushedTitle = { color: '#fff', fontSize: 17, fontFamily: DISPLAY_FONT, letterSpacing: 2 }
  pillText = { color: '#0b0c0e', fontWeight: '800', fontSize: 13, letterSpacing: 1 }
Replace: shop.tsx kicker/footLabel, drop/[id].tsx kicker/statLabel/sectionLabel, ticket/[id].tsx eyebrow/order, scan.tsx bannerIdleTitle/counterLabel, shows.tsx sectionLabel/month/eyebrow, fan-tickets.tsx label/eyebrow, fanmail.tsx sectionLabel, settings.tsx sectionLabel/pieceStatus, show-new.tsx / drop-new.tsx / drop-edit/[id].tsx field `label` (one shared copy, uppercase captions are a fine Stripe-style choice for artist forms).
sectionHead goes on every head that introduces a list: UPCOMING, PAST, MY TICKETS, THE REGISTRY, ARTIST, SENT, PICK YOUR NUMBER, TOP 3 (top8-card.tsx), the comments thread label (post/[id].tsx), so the three existing Anton heads stop drifting between 13/15/17.
shop.tsx page title letterSpacing 3 -> pageTitle (S333XSHOP and S333XHUB track identically).
Primary white pills, one rule, caps: drop/[id].tsx BUY, drop-new.tsx, show-new.tsx (14/800/0.5 -> pillText), scan.tsx and ticket/[id].tsx (already there), fanmail 'SEND TO THE ARTIST', sign-in 'SIGN IN', sign-up 'CREATE ACCOUNT', forgot-password 'SEND RESET LINK', account-suspended 'SIGN OUT'.
Leave the price treatments (shop card sans 16/700, drop Anton 30) and the auth title split (36/ls 4 wordmark vs 30/ls 1 heading) alone; that is hierarchy.

Shared <style> (or site.css) on index, privacy, terms, shop-terms, delete-account, confirm-email, reset-password:
  body { background:#000; color:#fff; font-family:"Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height:1.6 }
  .dim { color:#8a8a92 }   (replaces .muted #888 and #ddd body text)
  a { color:#c3cdd6; text-decoration:underline; text-decoration-color:#3a4048 }  a:hover { color:#fff }   (amber #fbbf24 removed from every page)
  h1 { font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif; letter-spacing:.09em; font-weight:400 }  with <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&display=swap">; Anton on the wordmark and page h1 only, never body or h2
  h2 { color:#fff; font-size:18px; font-weight:600; padding-top:24px; border-top:1px solid #222228 }   (ruled sections replace every .card box)
  input { background:#101013; border-radius:12px }  button { border-radius:999px; background:#fff; color:#000 }
  nav { border-top:1px solid #222228 }
Delete .card everywhere, the #0b0c0e / #131519 / #131315 / #222 values, and the uppercase 3px-tracked .sub eyebrow on the two auth pages (replace with a sentence-case lead line).
